# expected: an abandoned frame's `.drop` releases the values the suspension
# points' unwind rows name and the locals of the exit set, with reason
# `cancelled`. `holds`'s temporary has a row, so its `.drop` releases it;
# `gone`'s temporary ends before the point, so its `.drop` does not.
